### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get the feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Pass a profile (e.g. p01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "p01",
  "action": "PASS"
}

###

### 3. Like a profile that has not liked me (e.g. p02)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "p02",
  "action": "LIKE"
}

###

### 4. Like p04 (which has liked me -> mutual match!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "p04",
  "action": "LIKE"
}

###

### 5. Repeat a swipe (p04 already swiped -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "p04",
  "action": "LIKE"
}

###

### 6. Send an invalid action (SUPERLIKE -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "p03",
  "action": "SUPERLIKE"
}

###

### 7. Send an unknown profileId (unknown999 -> 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/swipe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileId": "unknown999",
  "action": "LIKE"
}

###

### 8. Get the matches (should include p04)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches
Accept: application/json
